msgstr "🖼️ Bildbetrachter"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/defaults.rs
msgid "🎬 Video Player"
msgstr "🎬 Videoplayer"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/defaults.rs
msgid "📄 PDF Viewer"
