#. TRANSLATORS: Shown on the text console when the graphical login screen failed to start. %1 is a login screen name (SDDM, Plasma Login Manager, …).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon: the login screen %1 did not start, so the computer shows this text "
"console instead."
msgstr ""
"Rexon: Der Anmeldebildschirm %1 ist nicht gestartet, deshalb zeigt der "
"Computer stattdessen diese Textkonsole."

#. TRANSLATORS: Shown on the text console when the login screen program still runs but its login window (the greeter) closed, so the screen stayed black. %1 is a login screen name (SDDM, Plasma Login Manager, …).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon: the login screen %1 is running, but its login window has closed, so "
"the computer shows this text console instead."
msgstr ""
"Rexon: Der Anmeldebildschirm %1 läuft, aber sein Anmeldefenster hat sich "
"geschlossen, deshalb zeigt der Computer stattdessen diese Textkonsole."

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output. %1 is a login screen name, %2 its state as systemd reports it (active/running).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "The login screen %1 is running (%2), but its login window has closed."
msgstr ""
"Der Anmeldebildschirm %1 läuft (%2), aber sein Anmeldefenster hat sich "
"geschlossen."

#. TRANSLATORS: Text console message. %1 is a login screen name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon had already brought back the previous login screen after %1 failed, "
"but it did not start either."
msgstr ""
"Nach dem Ausfall von %1 hat Rexon bereits den vorherigen Anmeldebildschirm "
"zurückgeholt, aber auch er ist nicht gestartet."

#. TRANSLATORS: Text console message, a list of causes follows.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "Likely cause:"
msgstr "Wahrscheinliche Ursache:"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text console message. %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME), %2 packages with versions, e.g. "qt6-base 6.12.0 with qt6-declarative 6.11.2".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "parts of %1 of different versions are installed (%2)"
msgstr "Teile von %1 sind in unterschiedlichen Versionen installiert (%2)"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text console message. Two lists of packages with versions, e.g. "qt6-base 6.12.0" and "qt6-declarative 6.11.2".
#. TRANSLATORS: Two lists of packages with versions, e.g. "kwin-x11 6.7.5" and "plasma-workspace 6.8.1".
#. TRANSLATORS: two lists of packages with versions, e.g.
#. "qt6-base 6.12.0" and "qt6-declarative 6.11.2, qt6-svg 6.11.2".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "%1 with %2"
msgstr "%1 neben %2"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text console message.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "The cause could not be found without the network."
msgstr "Ohne Netzwerk ließ sich die Ursache nicht finden."

#. TRANSLATORS: Text console message, lines of the login screen's log follow.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "Last lines of its log:"
msgstr "Letzte Zeilen seines Protokolls:"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text console message. %1 is a command, keep it as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "Log in below with your user name and password and run: %1"
msgstr ""
"Melden Sie sich unten mit Ihrem Benutzernamen und Passwort an und führen Sie "
"aus: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text console message.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "Rexon has not changed anything on this computer."
msgstr "Rexon hat an diesem Computer nichts verändert."

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output. %1 is a login screen name, %2 its state as systemd reports it (active/running).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "The login screen %1 is not broken (%2)."
msgstr "Der Anmeldebildschirm %1 ist nicht defekt (%2)."

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output. display-manager.service is a service name, keep it as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "No login screen is set up on this computer (display-manager.service)."
msgstr ""
"Auf diesem Computer ist kein Anmeldebildschirm eingerichtet (display-"
"manager.service)."

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output. %1 is a login screen name, %2 its state as systemd reports it.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "The login screen %1 did not start (%2)."
msgstr "Der Anmeldebildschirm %1 ist nicht gestartet (%2)."

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output when the login screen works, a list of problems follows.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "Rexon also noticed:"
msgstr "Rexon ist außerdem aufgefallen:"

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output, a list of suggestions follows.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "What you can do:"
msgstr "Was Sie tun können:"

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output. %1 is a command, keep it as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid ""
"When the network works, update the system so that all parts fit together: %1"
msgstr ""
"Sobald das Netzwerk funktioniert, aktualisieren Sie das System, damit alle "
"Teile zusammenpassen: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output. %1 is a command, keep it as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid ""
"If there is nothing to update yet, put the previous versions back from the "
"package cache: %1"
msgstr ""
"Wenn es noch keine Updates gibt, holen Sie die vorherigen Versionen aus dem "
"Paket-Cache zurück: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output. %1 is a command, keep it as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "Reinstall the login screen package: %1"
msgstr "Installieren Sie das Paket des Anmeldebildschirms neu: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output. %1 is a command, keep it as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "See the whole log of the login screen: %1"
msgstr "Das ganze Protokoll des Anmeldebildschirms: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output, the text Rexon saved when it switched the login screen follows.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "How to go back to the previous login screen:"
msgstr "So kehren Sie zum vorherigen Anmeldebildschirm zurück:"

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output. %1 is a command, keep it as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "Then restart the computer: %1"
msgstr "Starten Sie danach den Computer neu: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "This command only looks: it has not changed anything."
msgstr "Dieser Befehl prüft nur: Er hat nichts verändert."

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output on SteamOS (Steam Deck, Steam Machine). %1 is a command, keep it as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid "When the network works, update SteamOS: %1"
msgstr "Sobald das Netzwerk funktioniert, aktualisieren Sie SteamOS: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output on SteamOS. "Steam Deck Recovery Instructions" is the title of Valve's help page, keep it in English; help.steampowered.com is a web address.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid ""
"On SteamOS the system part is read-only, so single packages cannot be "
"reinstalled. If updating does not help, restore SteamOS with Valve's "
"recovery image: see \"Steam Deck Recovery Instructions\" on "
"help.steampowered.com."
msgstr ""
"Unter SteamOS ist der Systemteil schreibgeschützt, deshalb lassen sich "
"einzelne Pakete nicht neu installieren. Wenn das Aktualisieren nicht hilft, "
"stellen Sie SteamOS mit dem Wiederherstellungsabbild von Valve wieder her: "
"siehe „Steam Deck Recovery Instructions“ auf help.steampowered.com."

#. TRANSLATORS: "rexon doctor" output. %1 and %2 are login screen names.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/login_rescue.rs
msgid ""
"Going back to the previous login screen will not help: %1 and %2 both fail "
"to start."
msgstr ""
"Die Rückkehr zum vorherigen Anmeldebildschirm hilft nicht: Weder %1 noch %2 "
"startet."

