#. TRANSLATORS: help page in HTML. Keep the tags, the file names, the
#. JSON keys and the type names (theme-gtk, plugin…) as they are;
#. translate the prose and the sample values of "name", "author" and
#. "description".
#. Без ведущего перевода строки: xgettext срезает его у msgid, и
#. строка в коде разошлась бы с ключом каталога.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/qt_extensions.rs
msgid ""
"<p>A Rexon extension is a plain <b>ZIP archive</b> with the <code>.rxn</"
"code> extension.\n"
"Every type has the same layout:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>\n"
"extension.rxn (ZIP):\n"
"├── manifest.json     ← REQUIRED (format_version: 3)\n"
"├── preview.png       ← 620×348 (for the catalog and cards)\n"
"├── icon.png          ← 128×128 (lists in Rexon)\n"
"├── install.sh        ← for desktop-tool / plugin\n"
"├── uninstall.sh      ← for desktop-tool / plugin\n"
"├── app.desktop       ← for desktop-tool\n"
"├── README.md         ← optional, the description\n"
"└── data/             ← the extension's files\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>📋 Minimal manifest.json</h3>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"{\n"
"  \"format_version\": 3,\n"
"  \"id\": \"my-cool-theme\",\n"
"  \"name\": \"My Cool Theme\",\n"
"  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n"
"  \"author\": \"Me\",\n"
"  \"description\": \"What the extension does\",\n"
"  \"type\": \"theme-gtk\",\n"
"  \"tags\": [\"dark\", \"modern\"],\n"
"  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n"
"  \"homepage\": \"https://github.com/me/my-theme\",\n"
"  \"de_support\": [\"any\"]\n"
"}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>🎨 Categories (the <code>type</code> field)</h3>\n"
"<p><b>Appearance</b> — Rexon installs the files automatically:<br>\n"
"<code>theme-gtk, theme-icons, theme-cursors, theme-sounds,\n"
"theme-kde-global, theme-kde-colors, theme-kde-plasma, theme-kvantum,\n"
"theme-window-decoration, theme-login-screen, theme-plymouth, theme-conky,\n"
"theme-bundle, theme-plasmoid, wallpaper-pack, font-pack</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Desktop customization</b> — Rexon puts it into that desktop's own\n"
"folder and turns it on with the desktop's own tools:<br>\n"
"<code>kde-kwin-script, kde-kwin-effect, kde-window-switcher,\n"
"kde-wallpaper-plugin, theme-kde-splash, theme-kde-lockscreen,\n"
"gnome-shell-extension, theme-gnome-shell, cinnamon-applet, cinnamon-"
"desklet,\n"
"cinnamon-extension, theme-cinnamon, nemo-action, theme-xfwm4, theme-marco,\n"
"theme-lxqt</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Extensions</b> (you get a warning on install — they run code):<br>\n"
"<code>desktop-tool</code>, <code>plugin</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>📦 Packing</h3>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"cd my-extension/\n"
"zip -r ../my-extension.rxn .\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Drag the finished <code>.rxn</code> into the Rexon window or click\n"
"<b>「📦 From File」</b>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>🔗 Full documentation</h3>\n"
"<p>In the Rexon sources: <code>extensions/constants.py</code> has the full "
"list\n"
"of types and install paths.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Eine Rexon-Erweiterung ist ein gewöhnliches <b>ZIP-Archiv</b> mit der "
"Endung <code>.rxn</code>.\n"
"Der Aufbau ist für alle Typen gleich:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>\n"
"erweiterung.rxn (ZIP):\n"
"├── manifest.json     ← PFLICHT (format_version: 3)\n"
"├── preview.png       ← 620×348 (für Katalog/Karten)\n"
"├── icon.png          ← 128×128 (Listen in Rexon)\n"
"├── install.sh        ← für desktop-tool / plugin\n"
"├── uninstall.sh      ← für desktop-tool / plugin\n"
"├── app.desktop       ← für desktop-tool\n"
"├── README.md         ← optional, Beschreibung\n"
"└── data/             ← Dateien der Erweiterung\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>📋 Minimale manifest.json</h3>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"{\n"
"  \"format_version\": 3,\n"
"  \"id\": \"my-cool-theme\",\n"
"  \"name\": \"Mein cooles Design\",\n"
"  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n"
"  \"author\": \"Ich\",\n"
"  \"description\": \"Was die Erweiterung macht\",\n"
"  \"type\": \"theme-gtk\",\n"
"  \"tags\": [\"dark\", \"modern\"],\n"
"  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n"
"  \"homepage\": \"https://github.com/me/my-theme\",\n"
"  \"de_support\": [\"any\"]\n"
"}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>🎨 Kategorien (Feld <code>type</code>)</h3>\n"
"<p><b>Erscheinungsbild</b> – Rexon installiert die Dateien automatisch:<br>\n"
"<code>theme-gtk, theme-icons, theme-cursors, theme-sounds,\n"
"theme-kde-global, theme-kde-colors, theme-kde-plasma, theme-kvantum,\n"
"theme-window-decoration, theme-login-screen, theme-plymouth, theme-conky,\n"
"theme-bundle, theme-plasmoid, wallpaper-pack, font-pack</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Desktop-Anpassung</b> – Rexon legt sie in den Ordner des jeweiligen\n"
"Desktops und aktiviert sie mit dessen eigenen Mitteln:<br>\n"
"<code>kde-kwin-script, kde-kwin-effect, kde-window-switcher,\n"
"kde-wallpaper-plugin, theme-kde-splash, theme-kde-lockscreen,\n"
"gnome-shell-extension, theme-gnome-shell, cinnamon-applet, cinnamon-"
"desklet,\n"
"cinnamon-extension, theme-cinnamon, nemo-action, theme-xfwm4, theme-marco,\n"
"theme-lxqt</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Erweiterungen</b> (Warnung bei der Installation – es wird Code "
"ausgeführt):<br>\n"
"<code>desktop-tool</code>, <code>plugin</code></p>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>📦 Packen</h3>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"cd my-extension/\n"
"zip -r ../my-extension.rxn .\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Die fertige <code>.rxn</code> können Sie ins Rexon-Fenster ziehen oder "
"auf\n"
"<b>「📦 Aus Datei」</b> klicken.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h3>🔗 Vollständige Dokumentation</h3>\n"
"<p>In den Rexon-Quellen: <code>extensions/constants.py</code> – vollständige "
"Liste\n"
"der Typen und Installationspfade.</p>\n"

