#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Black and white"
msgstr "Schwarzweiß"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for GNOME.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Works on the whole screen through Rexon's own GNOME Shell extension."
msgstr ""
"Wirkt auf den ganzen Bildschirm über die eigene Erweiterung von Rexon für "
"GNOME Shell."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Cinnamon.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Works on the whole screen through Rexon's own Cinnamon extension."
msgstr ""
"Wirkt auf den ganzen Bildschirm über die eigene Erweiterung von Rexon für "
"Cinnamon."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Hyprland. "Speed 0" refers to the speed slider.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"Works on the whole screen through the Hyprland screen shader. Moving effects "
"make Hyprland redraw the whole screen every frame, which noticeably loads "
"the graphics card; at speed 0 the effect stays still and costs almost "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"Wirkt auf den ganzen Bildschirm über den Bildschirm-Shader von Hyprland. "
"Bewegte Effekte lassen Hyprland in jedem Bild den ganzen Bildschirm neu "
"zeichnen – das belastet die Grafikkarte spürbar; bei Geschwindigkeit 0 steht "
"der Effekt still und kostet fast nichts."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for KDE Plasma.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"KWin applies the effect to each window separately, not to the whole screen: "
"screen curvature and darkened corners are left out, and moving effects stay "
"still. Black and white is also available through Plasma's own color filter."
msgstr ""
"KWin legt den Effekt auf jedes Fenster einzeln, nicht auf den ganzen "
"Bildschirm: Bildschirmwölbung und abgedunkelte Ecken entfallen, bewegte "
"Effekte stehen still. Schwarzweiß gibt es auch über den eigenen Farbfilter "
"von Plasma."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for MATE, Xfce, LXQt on X11. picom is a program name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"Works on each window separately through picom, which replaces the desktop's "
"built-in compositor: screen curvature and darkened corners are left out."
msgstr ""
"Wirkt auf jedes Fenster einzeln über picom, das den eingebauten Compositor "
"der Desktop-Umgebung ersetzt: Bildschirmwölbung und abgedunkelte Ecken "
"entfallen."

#. TRANSLATORS: What must be installed for screen effects on MATE/Xfce/LXQt. picom is a program name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "picom instead of the built-in compositor"
msgstr "picom anstelle des eingebauten Compositors"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Wayfire. "filters" is a plugin name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"Works on the whole screen through the filters plugin. Wayfire gives effects "
"no clock, so moving effects stay still."
msgstr ""
"Wirkt auf den ganzen Bildschirm über das Modul filters. Wayfire gibt "
"Effekten keine Uhr, daher stehen bewegte Effekte still."

#. TRANSLATORS: What must be installed for screen effects on Wayfire. "filters" is a plugin name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "the filters plugin for Wayfire (from the AUR)"
msgstr "das Modul filters für Wayfire (aus dem AUR)"

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Pantheon.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"Pantheon can't add effects to the screen; only its own black and white "
"filter is available."
msgstr ""
"Pantheon kann keine Effekte auf den Bildschirm legen – es gibt nur seinen "
"eigenen Schwarzweißfilter."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for COSMIC.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"COSMIC can't add effects to the screen; only its own black and white filter "
"is available."
msgstr ""
"COSMIC kann keine Effekte auf den Bildschirm legen – es gibt nur seinen "
"eigenen Schwarzweißfilter."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for sway, river, labwc.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "This compositor has no way to apply effects to the screen."
msgstr "Dieser Compositor kann keine Effekte auf den Bildschirm legen."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for niri.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid ""
"niri doesn't support screen effects yet (requested from its developers)."
msgstr ""
"niri unterstützt noch keine Bildschirmeffekte (bei den Entwicklern "
"angefragt)."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Budgie.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Budgie has no way to add effects to the screen."
msgstr "Budgie kann keine Effekte auf den Bildschirm legen."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for Deepin's Treeland (Wayland session).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Treeland has no way to apply effects to the screen."
msgstr "Treeland kann keine Effekte auf den Bildschirm legen."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for an X11-only desktop started in a Wayland session.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Screen effects here work only in an X11 session."
msgstr "Bildschirmeffekte funktionieren hier nur in einer X11-Sitzung."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects support note for a desktop Rexon doesn't know.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Rexon doesn't know how to add screen effects on this desktop."
msgstr ""
"Rexon weiß nicht, wie in dieser Desktop-Umgebung Bildschirmeffekte "
"hinzugefügt werden."

#. TRANSLATORS: Toast after screen effects were changed.
