"%4 is set up as usual. It all happens in one pacman transaction: if it "
"doesn't go through, %1 stays installed.\n"
"\n"
"Replace it?"
msgstr ""
"%1 (Paket %2) wird entfernt, an seine Stelle kommt %3; danach wird %4 wie "
"gewohnt eingerichtet. Das alles ist eine einzige pacman-Transaktion: Klappt "
"sie nicht, bleibt %1 installiert.\n"
"\n"
"Ersetzen?"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Rexon can replace a conflicting package only with pacman."
msgstr "Ein kollidierendes Paket kann Rexon nur über pacman ersetzen."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the desktop being installed, %2 the installed
#. desktop, %3 a program both need (e.g. mutter), %4 the version %1
#. needs, %5 the package of that version, %6 the version %2 needs.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ %1 can't be installed next to %2: %1 needs %3 %4 (%5), and %2 needs %3 "
"%6; the two can't be installed at once. To install %1, you'd have to remove "
"%2 — Rexon doesn't remove another desktop by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ %1 lässt sich nicht neben %2 installieren: %1 braucht %3 %4 (%5), %2 aber "
"%3 %6; beide können nicht gleichzeitig installiert sein. Um %1 zu "
"installieren, müssten Sie %2 entfernen – einen anderen Desktop entfernt "
"Rexon nicht von sich aus."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the desktop being installed, %2 the installed
#. desktop, %3 the package of %1 (role and name), %4 the package of %2.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ %1 can't be installed next to %2: %3 conflicts with %4. To install %1, "
"you'd have to remove %2 — Rexon doesn't remove another desktop by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ %1 lässt sich nicht neben %2 installieren: %3 kollidiert mit %4. Um %1 zu "
"installieren, müssten Sie %2 entfernen – einen anderen Desktop entfernt "
"Rexon nicht von sich aus."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the package being installed, %2 an installed
#. package, %3 the installed packages that need %2 (comma-separated).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ Installation won't work: %1 conflicts with the installed package %2 "
"(needed by %3). pacman would have to remove %2 along with them, and Rexon "
"doesn't do that by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ Die Installation wird nicht gelingen: %1 kollidiert mit dem installierten "
"Paket %2 (benötigt von: %3). pacman müsste %2 zusammen mit ihnen entfernen, "
"und das tut Rexon nicht von sich aus."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the package being installed, %2 an installed package.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ Installation won't work: %1 conflicts with the installed package %2. "
"pacman would have to remove %2, and Rexon doesn't do that by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ Die Installation wird nicht gelingen: %1 kollidiert mit dem installierten "
"Paket %2. pacman müsste %2 entfernen, und das tut Rexon nicht von sich aus."

